  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "What is the best time to visit Red Fort?",
      "a": "The best time to visit Red Fort is October to March when Delhi weather is pleasantly cool. Morning hours (9:30 AM) are best to avoid crowds."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which is the nearest metro station to Red Fort?",
      "a": "Lal Qila Metro Station on the Violet Line is right opposite the main gate, and Chandni Chowk on the Yellow Line is an 8-minute walk away."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is Red Fort open on Mondays?",
      "a": "No, Red Fort is closed for visitors on Mondays for routine maintenance."
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the top attractions inside Red Fort?",
      "a": "Key highlights include Lahori Gate, Diwan-i-Aam, Diwan-i-Khas, Moti Masjid, Hayat Bakhsh Bagh, and the Archaeological Museum."
